  <div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-head"><span class=3D"chip build">B=
UILD</span><span class=3D"code-desc">Paste in Claude Code, then approve the=
 edits</span></div><pre>Build a small MCP server so Claude can send text me=
ssages through Twilio, in practice mode.
