gments and the first 40 characters of the body.
- get-message: look up one message by sid.
4. Practice mode: only when TWILIO_BASE_URL starts with http://127.0.0.1 or=
 http://localhost, right after each send, mark the message delivered by cal=
ling POST &lt;TWILIO_BASE_URL&gt;/_twilio/simulate/message-status with the =
form fields MessageSid and Status=3Ddelivered and the same Basic auth. The =
practice server leaves messages "queued" otherwise. Never call this against=
 real Twilio.
5. If Twilio returns an error, return its code and message to Claude in pla=
in words instead of crashing.
6. Create .mcp.json in the project root with exactly this content:
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "sms": {
      "command": "node",
      "args": ["mcp/sms-server.mjs"],
      "env": {
        "TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID": "${TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID:-AC00000000000000000000=
000000000000}",
        "TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN": "${TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN:-twilio_test_auth_token}",
        "TWILIO_BASE_URL": "${TWILIO_BASE_URL:-http://127.0.0.1:4000}",
        "TWILIO_FROM": "${TWILIO_FROM:-+15551234567}"
      }
    }
  }
}
