eal people. Keep that rule, and add that sending is allowed only to Twilio'=
s test number +15005550006 and to my own phone number, and that a guard wil=
l enforce this in the next step.
Commit. Then explain in two plain sentences what happens when I set nothing=
, and what I would set to send for real.</pre></div>
