HECK</span><span class=3D"code-desc">New session, then paste</span></div><p=
re>Check my practice launch. Don't send anything new and don't change any f=
iles.
1. Use the sms tools to list sent messages. Find the three whose bodies sta=
rt with [students], [gamers] and [budget-callers].
2. For each one, look up its status. Is it delivered?
3. Confirm that every message in the list went only to +15005550006 or to m=
y own number, the MY_PHONE value in .claude/settings.local.json. List any t=
hat didn't.
4. Compare each sent body with the body in that group's message 01 file. Do=
