5. Did any message need 2 segments? If so, by how many characters did the [=
group] tag push it over?
Give me a short table: Test | Pass or Fail | What you saw.
Then ask me two quick questions, one at a time: what would change if I swit=
ched from practice mode to my real Twilio account, and why the guard still =
matters then.</pre></div>
