ck">You'll know it worked when</div><p>Three messages tagged <code>[student=
s]</code>, <code>[gamers]</code> and <code>[budget-callers]</code> are all =
delivered, all to the test number. If one needed two segments, that is a re=
al lesson: every extra character costs money at scale.</p></div></div>
  <h4>Optional: send one real text to yourself</h4>
  <ol class=3D"steps-list">
    <li>Sign up for a free Twilio trial at twilio.com and verify your own p=
hone number (the same as <code>MY_PHONE</code>). Note your Account SID, Aut=
h Token and the trial phone number Twilio gives you. Never paste them into =
