UILD</span><span class=3D"code-desc">1 of 3 =C2=B7 Paste in plan mode</span=
></div><pre>Plan this first. Don't build anything yet.
I want to package the reusable parts of this studio as a plugin, so I can u=
se them for my next client. Plan a new folder next to this one, called stud=
io-kit, with:
- .claude-plugin/plugin.json (name studio-kit, version 0.1.0, a one-line de=
